[[270,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect battery negative pole.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237924\">2110A10</a></p><p>1. Unscrew fixing screws (1a) of coaxial actuator (1b); then remove\nactuator from the main gear shaft.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2016895.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[270,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Pay attention when assembling\ncoaxial actuator on shaft not to damage seal gasket (1a).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Assembly coaxial actuator on the main gear\nshaft and fix it with its fixing screws.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237924\">2110A10</a></p><p>Connect battery negative pole.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2016896.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove retaining ring (1a) and remove the rigid pipe with bleed\ndevice (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069651.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the hydraulic clutch actuator\n(1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069652.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the hydraulic clutch actuator back\nin its housing and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Refit the rigid pipe with bleed device\nand secure with the retaining ring.</p>"]]